From: Lancer-Nexus renderer follow-up
Subject: [PATCH] Split update and draw CPU frame timings

Expose per-frame CPU time for simulation updates and drawing plus RenderContext.EndFrame, preserving the existing total update/draw duration. Record both components in renderer CSV and percentile diagnostics.

